─────────────────────── Turn 13 · Quarterly main action ────────────────────────
                          Month 3 · Quarter 1 · Year 1                          

This quarter you may pick one main action towards your career goals, or none.   
Each main action changes your stats straight away. Choose based on your visible 
stats, the promotion windows and your long-term plan. The system applies the    
chosen action’s status_updates.                                                 

Choices:
  >>> [1] Apply for a key project — Join a high-profile project. Output, Skill 
and Network all rise.
      [2] Report results to your manager — Tell leadership about your wins. You 
become more visible and better recognised.
      [3] Fight for resources — Push for budget, headcount, or support for your 
work.
      [4] Apply for rotation — Rotate into another team to broaden your skills. 
Skill rises strongly.
      [5] Showcase results — Present your results to a wider audience. Output 
and Dignity rise.
      [6] Build a mentorship — Work with a senior mentor. Network and Skill 
improve.
      [7] Repair a key relationship — Mend a strained relationship. Network and 
Dignity recover.
      [8] Lay low and reduce risk — Keep your head down. Health recovers and 
HiddenRisk falls.
      [9] No action — Skip the main action this quarter. Your stats do not 
change.

